  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">H2S Palm Kernel Oil Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Huileries et Savonneries du Sud SARL (H2S) is a palm kernel oil processing enterprise. H2S will use grant funds to strengthen its working capital to consolidate its raw material supply capacities and improve its production planning and raw material inventory management.</narrative>
